  "type": "numerical",
  "level": 3,
  "question": {
    "text": "In a metre bridge experiment the balance point is obtained if the gaps are closed by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></math>. A shunt of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>X</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></math> is added to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></math> resistor to shift the balancing point by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>22</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cm</mi></math>. The value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>X</mi></math> is ______.",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "2",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/8f974d0e-47ac-4517-bf29-f04a0ec70601-9894943.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 236px;\" /></p><p>Case&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math>: No shunt is added</p><p>The initial balancing length&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>l</mi></math>&nbsp;of the bridge is,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>l</mi><mrow><mn>100</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>l</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>200</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>l</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>l</mi><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>l</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>40</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cm</mi></math></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/8d24fb54-2353-4c7f-b4af-645d94bc9553-100487e4-2884-4aa2-9745-521f16f132a6-9894943_2.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 257px;\" /></p><p>Case&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math>: When shunt is added</p><p>The new balancing length is,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>l</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>22</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>40</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>62</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cm</mi></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>62</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>37</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>X</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>X</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mfenced></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>X</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>.</p>",
    "image": null
  },
